    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/spenpo-resume</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>Display the resume with the [spcv_resume] shortcode</li>\n<li>Use the Settings-&gt;Resume Settings screen to configure auth settings</li>\n<li>Use <a href=\"https://github.com/spope851/spenpo-resume/blob/main/data/seed.sql\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this script</a> to populate the database with an example resume</li>\n<li>Use SQL to alter the data as needed</li>\n</ol>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://github.com/spope851/spenpo-resume\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">README</a> for more information.</p>\n<p>For support, please <a href=\"https://github.com/spope851/spenpo-resume/issues\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">create an issue</a> on our GitHub repository.</p>\n",
        "description": "<p>A WordPress plugin that provides a flexible and customizable way to display your resume/CV through shortcodes.</p>\n"
    },
